step Line up
  say color picks one of seven roles for a lane or a chip.
  line waiting: a, mine, b

step Pick
  say A lane with a color lights up its edge in that color when picked. Pick roles by meaning, such as amber for your own chip.
  line chosen: mine, a
  pick chosen
